urname>Kramarova</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Stiller</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The international classification of childhood cancer</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>1996</year><volume>68</volume><fpage>759</fpage><lpage>765</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Cancer||68|759||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8980180</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lannering</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Marky</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Nordborg</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Brain tumors in childhood and adolescence in west Sweden 1970&#x02013;1984. Epidemiology and survival</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1990</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>604</fpage><lpage>609</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer||66|604||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2364372</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Legler</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ries</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Warren</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Heineman</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaplan</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><name><surname>Linet</surname><given-names>Ms</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cancer surveillance series &#x0005b;corrected&#x0005d;: brain and other central nervous system cancers: recent trends in incidence and mortality</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1999</year><volume>91</volume><fpage>1382</fpage><lpage>1390</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst